WEBVTT

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.511
(IMITATES AIRPLANE ENGINE)

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:13.931
(GASPS)

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.645
(BOTH GASP)
BOY: Yay! Ice cream!

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:22.397
Huh?

00:00:23.498 --> 00:00:24.541
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:34.076
(ALL SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.663
(YELLING IN MINIONESE)

00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:39.998
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:42.584
Huh? (EXCLAIMING NERVOUSLY)

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:44.086
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.590
(CHATTERING IN MINIONESE)

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.925
(SCREAMING)

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.516
(YELLING)

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.770
(YELLING IN MINIONESE)

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:04.731
(SPEAKING MIONIONESE)

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.233
(SCREAMS)

00:01:17.604 --> 00:01:18.954
LUCY: All right, there he is.

00:01:19.602 --> 00:01:21.999
Suspect number eight, Floyd Eaglesan.

00:01:22.377 --> 00:01:23.625
Oh, okay.

00:01:23.954 --> 00:01:25.351
See if you can get closer. Go, go.

00:01:37.295 --> 00:01:38.390
All right.

00:01:39.215 --> 00:01:40.243
What the...

00:01:40.851 --> 00:01:42.893
Oh, no. That's not good.

00:01:43.562 --> 00:01:44.563
(GASPS)

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:45.689
Whoa!

00:01:46.312 --> 00:01:47.524
Hey, uh, what?

00:01:49.434 --> 00:01:50.507
Oh!

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:54.656
(GRUNTING)

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.199
AGNES: Hey, Gru!

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:58.938
Oh, girls!
What are you (CHUCKLES) doing here?

00:01:59.044 --> 00:02:00.604
Well, we thought we'd come visit
you at work.

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.540
So, you're saving the world in a
garbage can?

00:02:03.973 --> 00:02:06.209
(MOCK CHUCKLING)
Funny.

00:02:06.293 --> 00:02:07.906
Hey! There you are.

00:02:08.623 --> 00:02:09.768
Oh. Who's this?

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:13.637
Lucy, these are my girls,
Margo, Edith and Agnes.

00:02:14.272 --> 00:02:16.636
Girls, Lucy. Lucy, girls.

00:02:17.142 --> 00:02:18.680
-Hello.
-Hi.

00:02:27.505 --> 00:02:28.690
Are you single?

00:02:29.581 --> 00:02:30.692
Oh! Goodness.

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:35.275
Oh, hey! I have an idea.
Since Lucy and I have lots of work to do,

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.722
-why don't you girls go
-Bye!

00:02:36.736 --> 00:02:38.035
and explore the mall?

00:02:38.304 --> 00:02:40.911
Here is some money,
go buy some useless mall junk.

00:02:41.228 --> 00:02:42.662
Some headbands and...

00:02:42.746 --> 00:02:44.411
Are you gonna marry Lucy?

00:02:44.598 --> 00:02:48.507
Are you out of your gourd?
No! She just works with me.

00:02:48.692 --> 00:02:49.843
Plus, you love her.

00:02:50.116 --> 00:02:53.451
You love her! You love her!
You really, really love her!

00:02:53.484 --> 00:02:55.593
And you're gonna get married!
Okay, stop. This is a song of lies.

00:02:55.637 --> 00:02:56.803
-And I will be the flower girl!
-I don't even like her.

00:02:56.996 --> 00:02:58.520
Now, go have fun!

00:02:58.695 --> 00:03:00.347
(GIRLS LAUGHING)
(GROANS)

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.599
Almost forgot. Hugs!

00:03:02.942 --> 00:03:04.119
Good luck saving the world. Bye.

00:03:04.554 --> 00:03:05.619
AGNES: Bye, Gru!

00:03:08.845 --> 00:03:09.926
(CHUCKLES)

00:03:10.219 --> 00:03:13.178
Kids, right? They're funny.

00:03:13.473 --> 00:03:15.172
Those girls totally adore you.

00:03:15.497 --> 00:03:16.905
I bet you're a fun dad.

00:03:18.214 --> 00:03:20.312
Huh.
I am pretty fun.

00:03:29.918 --> 00:03:31.449
Is that stealing?

00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:34.041
Not if my wish was that
I would get a lot of free coins.

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:03.452
Whoa! (GASPS)

00:04:05.758 --> 00:04:06.913
Cool glasses.

00:04:07.127 --> 00:04:08.329
Oh. (CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:04:09.305 --> 00:04:10.380
I'm Antonio.

00:04:10.942 --> 00:04:12.277
I'm Margo.

00:04:12.886 --> 00:04:15.899
I was just going to get a cookie.
Care to join me?

00:04:16.323 --> 00:04:18.091
Uh, sure.

00:04:19.135 --> 00:04:20.844
I'm Margo.

00:04:26.758 --> 00:04:27.851
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:04:28.988 --> 00:04:31.021
Um, I'll catch up with you guys later.

00:04:31.526 --> 00:04:32.792
Bye!

00:04:34.672 --> 00:04:36.735
Can I be the first to say, "Ew!"

00:04:37.188 --> 00:04:38.653
We gotta go tell Gru!

00:04:43.753 --> 00:04:44.884
All right, I'm going in.

00:04:45.503 --> 00:04:47.854
LUCY: If it picks up any traces of
the serum, the sensor in your

00:04:47.918 --> 00:04:49.498
belt buckle will make a sound like this...

00:04:49.753 --> 00:04:50.859
Mee-maw! Mee-maw!

00:04:50.902 --> 00:04:52.403
-Mee-maw! Mee-maw!
-Okay!

00:04:52.447 --> 00:04:53.877
I get it. I get it.

00:04:59.341 --> 00:05:00.634
(SINISTER CHUCKLING)

00:05:01.137 --> 00:05:03.832
Welcome to Eagle Hair Club.

00:05:04.869 --> 00:05:08.183
It's about time you showed up, Mr. Gru.

00:05:08.266 --> 00:05:09.392
(SQUAWKS)

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:11.478
You know my name?

00:05:11.603 --> 00:05:12.646
(SINISTER CHUCKLING)

00:05:13.181 --> 00:05:15.941
When someone moves into the mall
who is folically-challenged,

00:05:16.747 --> 00:05:19.708
I make it my business to know all
about them.

00:05:20.196 --> 00:05:22.531
You are bald, and that is bad.

00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:25.325
There you go, my sweet.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.555
LUCY: I'm getting nothing so far.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:28.954
I think you need to move around.

00:05:34.617 --> 00:05:36.711
(ELECTRONIC BUZZING)

00:05:37.258 --> 00:05:39.506
Wow, this looks interesting. What is it?

00:05:40.194 --> 00:05:41.621
I take it you're an art lover?

00:05:41.649 --> 00:05:43.558
-LUCY: No serum.
-Yeah, not so much.

00:05:47.472 --> 00:05:50.323
Oh, how about this impressive trinket?

00:05:50.559 --> 00:05:52.950
(GASPS) I'd hardly call it
a trinket, Mr. Gru.

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:54.092
-LUCY: Nothing.
-The International...

00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:55.203
Yeah, I don't care.

00:05:58.977 --> 00:05:59.978
(YAWNS)

00:06:00.051 --> 00:06:01.194
(ELECTRONIC BEEPING)

00:06:01.278 --> 00:06:02.549
-LUCY: Mee-maw! Mee-maw!
-(GRUNTS)

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:04.948
LUCY: Hold on, I'm picking
up something. Behind that wall!

00:06:05.121 --> 00:06:06.575
Ah, and what do we have here?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:10.066
These are my trial wigs.
You should take one.

00:06:10.289 --> 00:06:13.706
No, thanks.
So, what's on the other side of the wall?

00:06:13.751 --> 00:06:16.001
-Here you are! Look at me! Focus!
- LUCY: Gru?

00:06:16.244 --> 00:06:20.333
I promise that this
wig will transform you from ugly

00:06:21.319 --> 00:06:23.675
to irresistible.

00:06:24.667 --> 00:06:26.379
AGNES: Margo has a boyfriend!

00:06:26.434 --> 00:06:27.887
And they're going on a date!

00:06:28.451 --> 00:06:29.859
Date? Boyfriend?

00:06:29.872 --> 00:06:31.167
-What?
-(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:06:43.738 --> 00:06:44.744
There she goes!

00:06:54.055 --> 00:06:55.999
(MARGO CHUCKLING)

00:06:56.684 --> 00:06:58.026
Oh, you're so funny.

00:06:58.509 --> 00:06:59.525
Gross!

00:06:59.916 --> 00:07:01.611
-Look, they're in love.
-Oh, no, no, no.

00:07:01.966 --> 00:07:04.007
Do not say that. No, no, no.

00:07:04.382 --> 00:07:08.351
And my dream is to one day
play video games for a living.

00:07:08.916 --> 00:07:10.055
Wow. (CHUCKLES)

00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:12.113
You're so complicated.

00:07:12.939 --> 00:07:14.200
-Margo.
-(GASPS)

00:07:14.433 --> 00:07:15.644
What is going on here?

00:07:16.402 --> 00:07:20.482
Oh, Gru, se llama Antonio. Me llamo Margo.

00:07:20.947 --> 00:07:24.027
Me llama-lama ding-dong.
Who cares? Let's go.

00:07:25.445 --> 00:07:26.488
(LATIN MUSIC PLAYING)

00:07:26.613 --> 00:07:27.656
(PATRONS CHEERING)

00:07:29.949 --> 00:07:31.034
MARGO: Whoa!

